# Source-only Editor Save installation and publication proposal

Production remains unchanged. This plan authenticates/selects sources and proposes adapters; it does not execute tests, original engines, browser sessions or benchmarks. Root owns actual installation/current receipts, browser checks, shared metadata and publication. `selected-file-map.json` binds exact proposed destination bytes and current baselines. `source-test-census.json` binds direct test registration lines to source hashes; `proposed-focused-selection.json` distinguishes the prospective correction45 subset from the expanded Editor78.

## Exact installation

Replace only client.mjs, server.mjs and app README.md from independently accepted frozen119; add save-publication.ui.test.mjs exact (four author controls). Client SHA256 is295e557ee7c341f2e1ca6fb68aac32e558455556d0c6490f6075970025afb65c; server9036f3f139f6aeb31d07cf159694e8db127e3b65a136c1aaf20bebcf14e0acad. Keep installed search/path/algorithm/Git modules and shared host/storage/catalog bytes unchanged. The source-assisted algorithm/original engine comparisons remain historical; this Save correction does not rerun or extend them.

The client updates the captured committed saved baseline/revision/byte count while retaining current item.content. Its pending flag is per document: typing remains enabled, another document can save, and duplicate Save/keyboard attempts for the same pending document are refused. Late completion publishes only while mounted and still owning the same document object; status belongs to that active document. The server captures primitive revision before any awaited resolution/queue, alongside existing captured path/content.

Install the four exact proposed adapter files under apps/editor: save-review-fixture.mjs, save-review-held.test.mjs, save-review-revision.test.mjs, save-review-adjacent.test.mjs. The helper replaces only runtime/library import paths and its working observation root with Studio .local/editor-save-review. Seven old bodies are byte-identical; moving their already-reviewed fixture prefix to an app-local helper is explicit, not a body/assertion change. Three queued revision bodies are byte-identical with imports/output root adapted to Studio .local/editor-save-revision-review. Four fresh bodies use the same helper through an import-only rename. These are owned synthetic working observations, never apps/results writes. Full-suite results stay immutable. The proposed adapters were not executed here; root must bind their actual installed-source run.

